{"parse": {"title": "Essence impling", "pageid": 18118, "revid": 15297398, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{External|rs}}\n{{Otheruses|the creature|the captured version|Essence impling jar}}\n{{Infobox Monster\n|name = Essence impling\n|image = [[File:Essence impling.png|250px]]\n|release = [[11 June]] [[2007]]\n|update = Impetuous Impulses\n|members = Yes\n|combat = No\n|size = \n|examine = An impling who likes magic. Magic!\n|xpbonus = \n|max hit = N/A\n|aggressive = N/A\n|poisonous = N/A\n|attack style = N/A\n|attack speed = N/A\n|hitpoints = 10{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1578083012046094337|date=6 October 2022|archiveurl=https://archive.ph/32D5m|archivedate=6 October 2022|quote=[Do implings have combat stats?] Attack, Defence, Strength: 0\nHitpoints: 10\nMelee: -10 accuracy, -10 damage\nStab/Crush/Slash/Ranged defence: -10\n(1/2)\n}}{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1578083333409591297|date=6 October 2022|archiveurl=https://archive.ph/xQCxu|archivedate=6 October 2022|quote=[Do implings have combat stats?] (2/2)\nMagic defence:\n+10 for baby-eclectic\n+20 for nature\n+30 for magpie\n+40 for ninja\n+50 for dragon & lucky\n}}\n|att = 0\n|str = 0\n|def = 0\n|mage = 1\n|range = 1\n|attbns = -10\n|strbns = -10\n|amagic = 0\n|mbns = 0\n|arange = 0\n|rngbns = 0\n|dstab = -10\n|dslash = -10\n|dcrush = -10\n|dmagic = 10\n|dlight = -10\n|dstandard = -10\n|dheavy = -10\n|poisonresistance = 100\n|venomresistance = 100\n|dpscalc = no\n|id = 1639,1649\n|leagueRegion = General\n}}\n[[File:Essence impling icon.png|left]]\nThe '''Essence impling''' is an impling that can be caught in the [[Impetuous Impulses]] minigame, and are located throughout [[Puro-Puro]] and [[Gielinor]]. It requires at least 42 [[Hunter]] to catch. It can also be caught barehanded at level 52 [[Hunter]].\n\nDespite its low [[Hunter]] level requirement, it can still be a very worthwhile impling to catch due to the large amount of valuable runes that it provides, such as [[Law rune]]s, [[Blood rune]]s, and [[Nature runes]], as well as a variety of other useful runes.\n\nUnlike its rarer counterparts, the Essence impling will always respawn within a minute of being caught in Puro Puro, so it can prove to be useful to find their exact spawn location within the maze.\n\n==Location==\n{{LocTableHead}}\n{{LocLine\n|Name = Essence Impling\n|location = [[Puro Puro]]\n|levels = N/A\n|members = Yes\n|mapID = 10128\n|plane = 0\n|2574,4317|2576,4337|2585,4298|2601,4343|2612,4318\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = General\n}}\n{{LocTableBottom}}\n\n==Rarity==\n{{Main|Impling#Spawn_mechanics}}\nOn the Gielinor surface, essence implings have a 10/100 chance to appear out of a low-tier invisible spawn, as well as a 20/100 chance of appearing out of a mid-tier invisible spawn. The same holds for the invisible spawns present in Puro-Puro. In addition to these however, there are also a number of fixed spawns in Puro-Puro that will always yield an essence impling. \n\nFor a more detailed breakdown of impling spawn mechanics, see the main article.\n\n==Hunter info==\n{{Hunter info\n|name = Essence impling\n|level = 42\n|xp = 27\n|wildxp = 29\n|trap = {{plink|Butterfly net}} or {{plink|Magic butterfly net}}\n|container = {{plink|Impling jar}}\n}}\n\nThe chance of successfully catching an essence impling is between ~54% at level 42 and 100% at level 91.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1573634900921573377|date=24 September 2022|archiveurl=https://archive.ph/leIV7|archivedate=30 September 2022}}\n\nWhen catching barehanded or with a [[magic butterfly net]], the catch chance is increased by 7.8%.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1413192817275457546|date=8 July 2021|archiveurl=https://archive.ph/s8phI|archivedate=21 May 2022|quote=For barehanded or a magic net, add 8 percentage points to the chances - which means you do get a no-fail chance.}}\n\n{{Skilling success chart|label=Essence impling catch chance|showbefore=no\n|label1=Butterfly net|low1=40|high1=275|req1=42|color1=saddlebrown|image1=Butterfly net.png\n|label2=Barehanded or magic butterfly net|low2=60|high2=295|req2=42|color2=green|image2=Magic butterfly net.png\n}}\n\n==Loot==\nAt current [[Grand Exchange]] prices, opening an essence impling jar gives {{Coins|{{ImpValue|essence|jar=yes}} round 0}} worth of loot, on average. This means opening essence impling jars makes an average profit of {{Coins|{{ImpValue|essence|jar=yes}}-{{GEP|Essence impling jar}} round 0}} per jar, however this does not include loot from clue scrolls.\n\nOn average, one would profit {{Coins|50*({{ImpValue|essence|jar=yes}}-{{GEP|Essence impling jar}}) round 0}} to get a [[clue scroll (medium)|medium clue scroll]] from essence impling jars at current [[Grand Exchange]] prices, excluding the rewards from the completed [[Treasure Trail]]s.\n\n{{DropLogProject|jagex=yes}}\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=General}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Pure essence|quantity=20 (noted)|rarity=1/10|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Water rune|quantity=30|rarity=1/10|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Air rune|quantity=30|rarity=1/10|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Fire rune|quantity=50|rarity=1/10|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Mind rune|quantity=25|rarity=1/10|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Body rune|quantity=28|rarity=1/10|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Chaos rune|quantity=4|rarity=1/10|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Cosmic rune|quantity=4|rarity=1/10|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Mind talisman|quantity=1|rarity=1/10|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Pure essence|quantity=35 (noted)|rarity=1/100|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Lava rune|quantity=4|rarity=1/100|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Mud rune|quantity=4|rarity=1/100|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Smoke rune|quantity=4|rarity=1/100|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Steam rune|quantity=4|rarity=1/100|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Death rune|quantity=13|rarity=1/100|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Law rune|quantity=13|rarity=1/100|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Blood rune|quantity=7|rarity=1/100|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Soul rune|quantity=11|rarity=1/100|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Nature rune|quantity=13|rarity=1/100|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Tertiary===\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=General}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Clue scroll (medium)|quantity=1|rarity=1/50|gemw=No|skill=Hunter}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 21 April 2016\n|update = Deadman Changes & Implings\n|poll = Old School Content Poll 41: Bank placeholders & Skillcapes\n|change = * Implings can now be caught barehanded, without a net, and those outside Puro Puro do not require a jar.\n* Medium clue scrolls have been added to essence impling drop tables.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Impling}}\n[[Category:Hunter]]"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:22:02.308771+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Pure_essence\" title=\"Pure essence\"><img alt=\"Pure essence.png: Essence impling drops Pure essence with rarity 1/10 in quantity 20 (noted)\" src=\"/images/Pure_essence.png?ed4b0\" decoding=\"async